      "en": "This could be systematised if we thought of God predeterGABRIEL MARCEL mining the series of causes at the beginning of time, but in that way we would be setting aside the essential element of the demonstration. (This leads me to a reflection on method. I can ask myself about the conditions under which I can think myself as created."
