      "sectionId": "appendix",
      "fr": "INDEX 1",
      "en": "But when we come across a philosopher who purports to remain at one of these obstacles and build his house on it, I can never avoid a feeling of arbitrariness, though there are plenty of reasons that militate in favour of a political system that one contemporary thinker presents as a genuine metaphysical opportunism."
